  "application_type_full": "Prior Approval: Change of use from Commercial, Business and Service (Use Class E) to Dwellinghouses (Use Class C3)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents: \r\rSite Location Plan\rExisting Floor Plan - Drawing No: 1798/01\rProposed Floor Plan - Drawing No: 1798/02\rExisting Elevation - Drawing No: 1798/03\rCross Section as Existing- Drawing No: 1798/04 \rAnalysis of Site Layout for Natural Light, prepared by Stinton Jones Consulting Engineers LLP, dated May 2026\rNoise Impact Assessment, prepared by Stinton Jones Consulting Engineers LLP, dated May 2026\rFlood Map for Planning\rTransport Statement, prepared by Citisense, dated May 2026\r\rReason: To ensure the development proceeds in accordance with the approved plans. \r",
    "Prior to first occupation of the development, the MVHR ventilation system shall be installed in full accordance with the details set out in the Noise Impact Assessment prepared by Stinton Jones Consulting Engineers LLP (May 2026), and shall be retained and maintained in working order thereafter for the lifetime of the development.\r\rReason: To ensure adequate ventilation can be achieved without reliance on opening windows, in order to protect the living conditions of future occupiers from noise arising from adjacent commercial premises, in accordance with Class MA, Paragraph W of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).\r"
  ],
